Transaction
A payment event processed through the payment system.
 
Successful Transaction
A transaction completed successfully.
 
Failed Transaction
A transaction that could not be completed.
 
Settled Transaction
A successful transaction whose funds have been transferred and finalized.
 
In Process
A transaction currently being processed.
 
Successful Amount
Total value of successful transactions.
 
 


 
Sales
Total revenue generated from customer orders.
 
Profit
Revenue remaining after subtracting costs.
 
Customer
A unique customer who places one or more orders.
 
Order
A unique purchase identified by Order_ID.
 
 


 
